!Sample_data_processing = Only the tags aligning to one position on the genome were considered for further analysis. Further analysis was performed with 36 (single end) or one time 50 bp (paired end) aligned sequence reads.
!Sample_data_processing = The output data were converted to Browser Extensible Data (BED) files for downstream analysis and Wiggle (WIG) / BedGraph files for viewing.
!Sample_data_processing = Details of the computational analysis performed are described in the Supplementary Information of the accompanying paper
!Sample_data_processing = All sequencing analyses were conducted based on the Mus musculus NCBI m37 genome assembly (MM9; assembly July 2007),  the Bos_taurus_UMD_3.1/bosTau6 or the SGSC Sscrofa10.2/susScr3
!Sample_data_processing = Genome_build: NCBI37/mm9; Bos_taurus_UMD_3.1/bosTau6; SGSC Sscrofa10.2/susScr3
